 entry_SYSCALL_64_after_hwframe+0x77/0x7f

Fixes: 1da177e4c3f4 ("Linux-2.6.12-rc2")
Reported-by: VEGA <vega@nebusec.ai>
Signed-off-by: Fernando Fernandez Mancera <fmancera@suse.de>
